{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117023419345-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117030152\"/><p>上水發生懷疑盜竊案。昨晚（16日）10時06分，天平路50號安盛苑一單位的姓鄭(65歲)男住戶報案，指其寓所內一批財物不翼而飛。</p><p>警員接報到場，鄭男經點算後，共損失一條金手鏈、一枚金戒指、一條金頸鏈、一條鑽石手鏈，以及約3,000港元現金，所有失物總值約11萬港元。經初步調查後，將案件列作「盜竊」處理，目前暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T19:22:34.558095+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T18:34:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T23:15:07.844433+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T19:15:54.484837+00:00","content_hash":"84899175368eb289eeb402c49372bb39dba4058bcf692108d76dc33ddac419f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}